ution = 36 + 9*34 = 36 + 306 = 342.\n\n2. Thin uniform rod: m=1, ends (-3,-4) and (2,-1). Centre = midpoint = ((-3+2)/2, (-4+(-1))/2) = (-1/2, -5/2) = (-0.5, -2.5). Length L = distance between ends: delta x = 5, delta y = 3, so L = sqrt(5^2+3^2)=sqrt(34). So L^2 = 34. I_cm = mL^2/12 = 1*34/12 = 34/12 = 17/6. d^2 = (x_c - 2)^2 + (y_c - 2)^2 = (-0.5-2)^2 + (-2.5-2)^2 = (-2.5)^2 + (-4.5)^2 = 6.25 + 20.25 = 26.5 = 53/2. Contribution = 17/6 + 1*53/2 = 17/6 + 159/6 = 176/6 = 88/3 ≈ 29.3333.\n\nBut better to keep as fraction: 17/6 + 53/2 = 17/6 + 159/6 = 176/6 = 88/3.\n\n3. Point mass: m=3, at (-4,1). I_cm = 0. d^2 = (-4-2)^2 + (1-2)^2 = (-6)^2 + (-1)^2 = 36+1=37. Contribution = 0 + 3*37 = 111.\n\n4. Thin uniform ring: m=2, R=2, centre (-5,-2). I_cm = 2*4=8. d^2 = (-5-2)^2 + (-2-2)^2 = (-7)^2 + (-4)^2 = 49+16=65. Contribution = 8 + 2*65 = 8+130=138.\n\n5. Thin uniform rod: m=3, ends (-1,-1) and (1,1). Centre = (0,0). Length L = distance: delta=2 each, L=sqrt(2^2+2^2)=sqrt(8)=2√2, L^2=8. I_cm = 3*8/12 = 24/12=2. d^2 = (0-2)^2 + (0-2)^2 = 4+4=8. Contribution = 2 + 3*8 = 2+24=26.\n\n6. Thin uniform ring: m=5, R=1, centre (2,5). I_cm = 5*1^2=5. d^2 = (2-2)^2 + (5-2)^2 = 0+9=9. Contribution = 5 + 5*9 = 5+45=50.\n\n7. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=2, a=4, b=1 (sides parallel to axes), centre (-5,4). I_cm = m(a^2+b^2)/12 = 2*(16+1)/12 = 2*17/12 = 34/12 = 17/6. d^2 = (-5-2)^2 + (4-2)^2 = (-7)^2 + 2^2 = 49+4=53. Contribution = 17/6 + 2*53 = 17/6 + 106 = 17/6 + 636/6 = 653/6 ≈ 108.8333.\n\n8. Thin uniform ring: m=6, R=3, centre (3,5). I_cm = 6*9=54. d^2 = (3-2)^2 + (5-2)^2 = 1^2 + 3^2 = 1+9=10. Contribution = 54 + 6*10 = 54+60=114.\n\n9. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=1, a=3, b=3, centre (-2,3). I_cm = 1*(9+9)/12 = 18/12 = 3/2. d^2 = (-2-2)^2 + (3-2)^2 = (-4)^2 + 1^2 = 16+1=17. Contribution = 3/2 + 1*17 = 3/2 + 34/2 = 37/2 = 18.5.\n\n10. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=1, a=2, b=1, centre (2,-3). I_cm = 1*(4+1)/12 = 5/12. d^2 = (2-2)^2 + (-3-2)^2 = 0 + (-5)^2 = 25. Contribution = 5/12 + 1*25 = 5/12 + 300/12 = 305/12 ≈ 25.4167.\n\n11. Thin uniform rod: m=2, ends (-4,5) and (3,2). Centre = ((-4+3)/2, (5+2)/2) = (-1/2, 7/2) = (-0.5, 3.5). Length L: delta x = 7, delta y = -3, so sqrt(49+9)=sqrt(58). L^2=58. I_cm = 2*58/12 = 116/12 = 29/3. d^2 = (-0.5-2)^2 + (3.5-2)^2 = (-2.5)^2 + (1.5)^2 = 6.25 + 2.25 = 8.5 = 17/2. Contribution = 29/3 + 2*(17/2) = 29/3 + 17 = 29/3 + 51/3 = 80/3 ≈ 26.6667.\n\n12. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=2, a=3, b=2, centre (1,2). I_cm = 2*(9+4)/12 = 2*13/12 = 26/12 = 13/6. d^2 = (1-2)^2 + (2-2)^2 = (-1)^2+0 = 1. Contribution = 13/6 + 2*1 = 13/6 + 12/6 = 25/6 ≈ 4.1667.\n\n13. Thin uniform rod: m=2, ends (-2,-3) and (2,3). Centre = (0,0). L: delta x=4, delta y=6, L^2=16+36=52. I_cm = 2*52/12 = 104/12 = 26/3. d^2 = (0-2)^2+(0-2)^2 = 4+4=8. Contribution = 26/3 + 2*8 = 26/3 + 16 = 26/3 + 48/3 = 74/3 ≈ 24.6667.\n\n14. Point mass: m=4, at (3,5). I_cm=0. d^2=(3-2)^2+(5-2)^2=1+9=10. Contribution=4*10=40.\n\n15. Thin uniform rod: m=3, ends (3,2) and (-5,4). Centre = ((3-5)/2, (2+4)/2) = (-2/2, 6/2)= (-1,3). L: delta x=8, delta y= -2, L^2=64+4=68. I_cm = 3*68/12 = 204/12 = 17. d^2 = (-1-2)^2 + (3-2)^2 = (-3)^2+1^2=9+1=10. Contribution = 17 + 3*10 = 17+30=47.\n\n16. Thin uniform rod: m=1, ends (5,1) and (0,0). Centre = (2.5, 0.5) = (5/2, 1/2). L: delta x=5, delta y=1, L^2=25+1=26. I_cm = 1*26/12 = 13/6. d^2 = (2.5-2)^2 + (0.5-2)^2 = (0.5)^2 + (-1.5)^2 = 0.25 + 2.25 = 2.5 = 5/2. Contribution = 13/6 + 1*(5/2) = 13/6 + 15/6 = 28/6 = 14/3 ≈ 4.6667.\n\n17. Thin uniform ring: m=4, R=2, centre (0,3). I_cm = 4*4=16. d^2 = (0-2)^2+(3-2)^2 = 4+1=5. Contribution = 16 + 4*5 = 16+20=36.\n\n18. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=7, a=2, b=2, centre (-1,-5). I_cm = 7*(4+4)/12 = 7*8/12 = 56/12 = 14/3. d^2 = (-1-2)^2 + (-5-2)^2 = (-3)^2 + (-7)^2 = 9+49=58. Contribution = 14/3 + 7*58 = 14/3 + 406 = 14/3 + 1218/3 = 1232/3 ≈ 410.6667.\n\n19. Point mass: m=1, at (2,-5). I_cm=0. d^2 = (2-2)^2+(-5-2)^2 = 0+49=49. Contribution = 1*49=49.\n\n20. Point mass: m=5, at (-3,2). I_cm=0. d^2 = (-3-2)^2+(2-2)^2 = (-5)^2+0=25. Contribution=5*25=125.\n\n21. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=7, a=2, b=1, centre (4,-2). I_cm = 7*(4+1)/12 = 7*5/12 = 35/12. d^2 = (4-2)^2+(-2-2)^2 = 2^2 + (-4)^2 = 4+16=20. Contribution = 35/12 + 7*20 = 35/12 + 140 = 35/12 + 1680/12 = 1715/12 ≈ 142.9167.\n\n22. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=3, a=2, b=4, centre (5,5). I_cm = 3*(4+16)/12 = 3*20/12 = 60/12 = 5. d^2 = (5-2)^2+(5-2)^2 = 3^2+3^2=9+9=18. Contribution = 5 + 3*18 = 5+54=59.\n\n23. Point mass: m=1, at (-2,4). I_cm=0. d^2 = (-2-2)^2+(4-2)^2 = (-4)^2+2^2=16+4=20. Contribution=20.\n\n24. Uniform solid disk: m=8, R=1, centre (2,5). I_cm = mR^2/2 = 8*1/2=4. d^2 = (2-2)^2+(5-2)^2 = 0+9=9. Contribution = 4 + 8*9 = 4+72=76.\n\n25. Uniform solid disk: m=2, R=2, centre (-3,1). I_cm = 2*4/2=4. d^2 = (-3-2)^2+(1-2)^2 = (-5)^2+(-1)^2=25+1=26. Contribution = 4 + 2*26 = 4+52=56.\n\n26. Thin uniform ring: m=8, R=3, centre (-4,2). I_cm = 8*9=72. d^2 = (-4-2)^2+(2-2)^2 = (-6)^2+0=36. Contribution = 72 + 8*36 = 72+288=360.\n\n27. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=6, a=1, b=2, centre (5,-5). I_cm = 6*(1+4)/12 = 6*5/12 = 30/12 = 5/2. d^2 = (5-2)^2+(-5-2)^2 = 3^2+(-7)^2 = 9+49=58. Contribution = 5/2 + 6*58 = 2.5 + 348 = 350.5 = 701/2.\n\n28. Thin uniform rod: m=2, ends (0,5) and (-5,1). Centre = ((-5+0)/2, (5+1)/2) = (-2.5, 3) = (-5/2, 3). L: delta x=5, delta y=4, L^2=25+16=41. I_cm = 2*41/12 = 82/12 = 41/6. d^2 = (-2.5-2)^2 + (3-2)^2 = (-4.5)^2 + 1^2 = 20.25 + 1 = 21.25 = 85/4. Contribution = 41/6 + 2*(85/4) = 41/6 + 85/2 = 41/6 + 255/6 = 296/6 = 148/3 ≈ 49.3333.\n\n29. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=3, a=2, b=4, centre (-1,-4). I_cm = 3*(4+16)/12 = 3*20/12 = 60/12 = 5. d^2 = (-1-2)^2+(-4-2)^2 = (-3)^2+(-6)^2 = 9+36=45. Contribution = 5 + 3*45 = 5+135=140.\n\n30. Uniform solid disk: m=6, R=3, centre (3,1). I_cm = 6*9/2 = 54/2? Actually mR^2/2 = 6*9/2 = 54/2 = 27. d^2 = (3-2)^2+(1-2)^2 = 1+1=2. Contribution = 27 + 6*2 = 27+12=39.\n\n31. Thin uniform rod: m=1, ends (1,-2) and (3,-4). Centre = (2, -3). L: delta x=2, delta y=-2, L^2=4+4=8. I_cm = 1*8/12 = 2/3. d^2 = (2-2)^2+(-3-2)^2 = 0+25=25. Contribution = 2/3 + 1*25 = 2/3 + 75/3 = 77/3 ≈ 25.6667.\n\n32. Thin uniform ring: m=1, R=2, centre (-4,5). I_cm = 1*4=4. d^2 = (-4-2)^2+(5-2)^2 = (-6)^2+3^2=36+9=45. Contribution = 4 + 1*45 = 49.\n\n33. Point mass: m=5, at (-5,1). I_cm=0. d^2 = (-5-2)^2+(1-2)^2 = (-7)^2+(-1)^2 = 49+1=50. Contribution=5*50=250.\n\n34. Thin uniform rod: m=5, ends (2,-5) and (-5,4). Centre = ((2-5)/2, (-5+4)/2) = (-3/2, -1/2) = (-1.5, -0.5). L: delta x=7, delta y=-9, L^2=49+81=130. I_cm = 5*130/12 = 650/12 = 325/6. d^2 = (-1.5-2)^2 + (-0.5-2)^2 = (-3.5)^2 + (-2.5)^2 = 12.25 + 6.25 = 18.5 = 37/2. Contribution = 325/6 + 5*(37/2) = 325/6 + 185/2 = 325/6 + 555/6 = 880/6 = 440/3 ≈ 146.6667.\n\n35. Thin uniform rectangular plate: m=9, a=2, b=3, centre (-4,2). I_cm = 9*(4+9)/12 = 9*13/12 = 117/12 = 39/4. d^2 = (-4-2)^2+(2-2)^2 = (-6)^2+0=36. Contribution = 39/4 + 9*36 = 39/4 + 324 = 39/4 + 1296/4 = 1335/4 = 333.75.\n\n36. Thin uniform rod: m=9, ends (-4,-5) and (-2,-1). Centre = (-3, -3). L: delta x=2, delta y=4, L^2=4+16=20. I_cm = 9*20/12 = 180/12 = 15. d^2 = (-3-2)^2+(-3-2)^2 = (-5)^2+(-5)^2 = 25+25=50. Contribution = 15 + 9*50 = 15+450=465.\n\n37. Thin uniform rod: m=7, ends (-2,-2) and (4,1). Centre = (1, -0.5) = (1, -1/2). L: delta x=6, delta y=3, L^2=36+9=45. I_cm = 7*45/12 = 315/12 = 105/4. d^2 = (1-2)^2 + (-0.5-2)^2 = (-1)^2 + (-2.5)^2 = 1 + 6.25 = 7.25 = 29/4. Contribution = 105/4 + 7*(29/4) = 105/4 + 203/4 = 308/4 = 77.\n\n38. Uniform solid disk: m=2, R=1, centre (-2,2). I_cm = 2*1/2 = 1. d^2 = (-2-2)^2+(2-2)^2 = (-4)^2+0=16. Contribution = 1 + 2*16 = 1+32=33.\n\n39. Thin uniform rod: m=5, ends (3,-1) and (2,4). Centre = (2.5, 1.5) = (5/2, 3/2). L: delta x=1, delta y=5, L^2=1+25=26. I_cm = 5*26/12 = 130/12 = 65/6. d^2 = (2.5-2)^2 + (1.5-2)^2 = (0.5)^2 + (-0.5)^2 = 0.25+0.25=0.5 = 1/2. Contribution = 65/6 + 5*(1/2) = 65/6 + 5/2 = 65/6 + 15/6